OL,3,GNEWSACommunity farm vandalism getting
OL,4,A'worse and worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandalism at a community farm is using
OL,7,Fup resources dedicated to helping
OL,8,Ffamilies in the area, the group that
OL,9,Fruns it have said.
OL,11,FTorched caravans, destroyed playhouses
OL,12,Fand ripped-out CCTV cameras are a
OL,13,Fnumber of the incidents the team at
OL,14,FKirkstall Valley Farm have experienced
OL,15,Fat the site in west Leeds.
OL,17,FAdele Rae, chief executive of Kirkstall
OL,18,FValley Development Trust, said the
OL,19,Fcommunity group "tries to be really
OL,20,Fresourceful, but there's an end to our
OL,21,Fenergy".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
