OL,3,GNEWSACommunity farm vandalism getting
OL,4,A'worse and worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The trouble is that the money that
OL,7,Fwe're using to pick up the pieces is
OL,8,Fmoney that we'd use to feed people and
OL,9,Fdo affordable events for families in
OL,10,Fthe area," she said.
